   "snippet": {
    "title": "Thanos Dimadis",
    "description": "Thanos Dimadis is an author, a communications strategist, and a former journalist who worked as a foreign correspondent from Washington, D.C., and New York. He is the author of two books (DimadisBook.com). Thanos is a distinguished recipient of the Knight Bagehot Fellowship of Columbia Journalism School and a distinguished recipient of a scholarship from the Alexander Onassis Foundation. Thanos holds four master degrees; Political Management (George Washington University), Media (City University of London), Political Science (National and Kapodistrian University of Athens.), and European Law and Policy (Panteion University of Social and Political Sciences of Athens,) where he also received his B.A. in journalism. He also completed the Executive Education Program, Leadership in the 21st Century, from Harvard Kennedy School. He currently serves as a board member of the Harvard Kennedy School Alumni Association of New York.\n",
